all the inactive constraints.

00:17:06.609 --> 00:17:08.109
There is an
additional condition,

00:17:08.109 --> 00:17:12.210
that is the
multipliers mu j that

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:15.770
relate with the inequality
constraints have to be positive.

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:17.908
There are some kind of
geometric interpretations

00:17:17.908 --> 00:17:19.450
and proofs we could
do here, but it's

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:22.290
